v1.3.8 (2026-05-15)
-------------------
Fix: YubiKey not detected by OpenVPN Connect after registration.

Registration (.ovpn profile):
- Fixed: profile generated during registration now includes pkcs11-providers
  and pkcs11-id directives so OpenVPN Connect can load libykcs11.dll and
  locate the correct YubiKey slot automatically — previously these directives
  were missing and the YubiKey was invisible to OpenVPN Connect
- vpnweb-helper.py now passes ?serial= when fetching the .ovpn so the
  provider and key ID are embedded with the correct YubiKey serial number
